Forwarded: https://github.com/BuddiesOfBudgie/budgie-desktop/pull/124
Author: David Mohammed <fossfreedom@ubuntu.com>
Last-Update: 2022-07-15
Description: [PATCH2/5] Introduce our native screenshot capability. This commit adds
 a native screenshot capability namely the ability to take screengrabs through
 a dedicated graphical interface and also directly through screenshot keyboard
 shortcuts. A screenshot manager is used to screengrab directly via the window
 manager. A screenshot controller is used to interact with user via a
 graphical interface - two windows first to define what and how to grab second
 after the screengrab for what to-do with the screengrab. A budgie-screenshot
 executable is used to invoke the first window.

